msgid "Kernels and initramfs"
msgstr "内核与 initramfs"

#. id dd55a487
#: index.html
msgid ""
"Add or remove kernels in one click. Works with mkinitcpio and dracut, and "
"updates your GRUB entries for you."
msgstr ""
"一键添加或移除内核。支持 mkinitcpio 和 dracut，并会自动为你更新 GRUB 条目。"

#. id d5617d27
#: index.html
msgid "Kernels"
msgstr "内核"

#. id 6f8072ca
#: index.html
msgid "Boot splash"
msgstr "启动画面"

#. id 31031931
#: index.html
msgid ""
"Install and switch Plymouth themes, with bootloader wiring for systemd-boot, "
"GRUB, limine and rEFInd &mdash; and a fix for broken initramfs hooks."
msgstr ""
"安装并切换 Plymouth 主题，支持 systemd-boot、GRUB、limine 和 rEFInd 引导程序"
"的对接，还能修复损坏的 initramfs 钩子。"

