msgid "Logging"
msgstr "日志记录"

#. id 391f30ce
#: index.html
msgid "Users, locale and access"
msgstr "用户、区域设置与访问"

#. id 55f7d50e
#: index.html
msgid ""
"Create and configure user accounts, set locale, keyboard layout and "
"timezone, and turn on accessibility options."
msgstr "创建并配置用户账户，设置区域、键盘布局和时区，并开启无障碍选项。"

#. id 9f8a2389
#: index.html
msgid "User"
msgstr "用户"

#. id 8970f0e6
#: index.html
msgid "Locale"
msgstr "区域设置"

#. id d660049b
#: index.html
msgid "Accessibility"
msgstr "无障碍功能"

#. id cf01481f
#: index.html
msgid "Privacy"
msgstr "隐私"

#. id 54796043
#: index.html
msgid ""
"hBlock DNS-level ad blocking and a handful of settings that keep your system "
"to yourself."
msgstr "通过 hBlock 在 DNS 层面屏蔽广告，外加一些让你的系统保护隐私的设置。"

#. id 1d2042b6
#: index.html
msgid "AI tools and extras"
msgstr "AI 工具与更多"

#. id 8a7ad178
#: index.html
msgid ""
"Claude AI integration for help with your own system, office software "
"installers, and the ISO tooling if you build your own."
msgstr ""
"与 Claude AI 集成，帮你处理自己系统上的事务；还有办公软件安装器，以及自己构"
"建 ISO 时用到的 ISO 工具。"

#. id 58d44d0c
#: index.html
msgid "AI Tools"
msgstr "AI 工具"

#. id 6c3a72ea
#: index.html
msgid "Office"
msgstr "办公"

#. id 4f325d99
#: index.html
msgid "ISO"
msgstr "ISO"

#. id 32cf39eb
#: index.html
msgid "Two steps and you are running"
msgstr "两步即可开始使用"

#. id 6264a9e9
#: index.html
msgid ""
"ATT ships from <code class=\"chip\">nemesis_repo</code>, a signed pacman "
"repository. Add the repo once, then install ATT like any other package. "
"Everything below is a normal command you can read before you run it."
msgstr ""
"ATT 通过 <code class=\"chip\">nemesis_repo</code> 发布，这是一个带签名的 "
"pacman 软件源。只需添加一次软件源，然后像安装其他软件包一样安装 ATT。下面都是"
"普通命令，运行前你可以先读一遍。"

#. id 903e89f7
#: index.html
msgid "Step 1 &mdash; add the repo to <code>/etc/pacman.conf</code>"
msgstr "第 1 步：把软件源添加到 <code>/etc/pacman.conf</code>"

#. id af74f7c5
#: index.html
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "复制"

#. id bce18d41
#: index.html
msgid "Prefer a script? This does the same thing"
msgstr "更喜欢脚本？它做的是同样的事"

#. id 1d28ba54
#: index.html
msgid ""
"<b>About the signature.</b> <code>nemesis_repo</code> is PGP-signed by the "
"Kiro key, trusted through <code>kiro-keyring</code>, and it inherits your "
"global <code>SigLevel</code>. If you are adding the repo by hand before that "
"keyring is installed, set <code>SigLevel = Optional</code> for this repo "
"until it is in place."
msgstr ""
"<b>关于签名。</b> <code>nemesis_repo</code> 由 Kiro 密钥进行 PGP 签名，通过 "
"<code>kiro-keyring</code> 建立信任，并继承你的全局 <code>SigLevel</code>。如"
"果你在安装该密钥环之前就手动添加软件源，请先为这个软件源设置 <code>SigLevel "
"= Optional</code>，等密钥环装好后再改回来。"

#. id 0f795ccf
#: index.html
msgid "Step 2 &mdash; update and install"
msgstr "第 2 步：更新并安装"

#. id bf20bc7a
#: index.html
msgid ""
"Then launch <b>ArchLinux Tweak Tool</b> from your application menu. It asks "
"for administrative rights only when an action genuinely needs them."
msgstr ""
"然后从应用程序菜单启动 <b>ArchLinux Tweak Tool</b>。只有在某个操作确实需要"
"时，它才会请求管理员权限。"

#. id 5d60c7dd
#: index.html
msgid "Compatibility"
msgstr "兼容性"

#. id 09edb1e9
#: index.html
msgid "Built for Arch, at home on Arch-based systems"
msgstr "为 Arch 而生，在 Arch 系系统上同样如鱼得水"

#. id bf51db4f
#: index.html
msgid ""
"ATT started life on ArcoLinux and now runs on plain Arch and on the Arch-"
"based systems people actually use &mdash; Artix, Manjaro, CachyOS, Kiro and "
"many more. Where a distribution does things its own way, ATT detects it and "
"adapts the interface instead of fighting it."
msgstr ""
"ATT 诞生于 ArcoLinux，如今可以在原版 Arch 以及人们实际在用的 Arch 系系统上运"
"行，比如 Artix、Manjaro、CachyOS、Kiro 等等。当某个发行版有自己的做法时，ATT "
"会检测到并调整界面去适应，而不是与之对抗。"

#. id 4a3014d2
#: index.html
msgid ""
"<b>You need:</b> an Arch or Arch-based system, Python 3.8 or later, GTK 4.6 "
"or later, and pacman."
msgstr ""
"<b>你需要：</b> 一个 Arch 或 Arch 系系统、Python 3.8 或更高版本、GTK 4.6 或更"
"高版本，以及 pacman。"

#. id a9a631e7
#: index.html
msgid ""
"<b>Optional, for some pages:</b> alacritty for package operations, "
"fastfetch, and your shell of choice."
msgstr ""
"<b>部分页面可选：</b> 用于软件包操作的 alacritty、fastfetch，以及你常用的 "
"Shell。"

#. id f5fb13b9
#: index.html
msgid ""
"The authoritative, always-current list of supported distributions lives in "
"the source &mdash; see the <a href=\"https://github.com/kirodubes/archlinux-"
"tweak-tool\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GitHub "
"repository</a>."
msgstr ""
"受支持发行版的权威且始终最新的列表在源码中，请查看 <a href=\"https://"
"github.com/kirodubes/archlinux-tweak-tool\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">GitHub 仓库</a>。"

#. id d615ebe8
#: index.html
